- **`src/Domain/Model/MonitoredResource.php`:**
  ```php
  // ... existing constants
  public const STATUS_QUARANTINED = 'quarantined';

  public function quarantine(): void {
      if ($this->isQuarantined()) {
          throw new \DomainException('Resource is already quarantined.');
      }
      $this->status = self::STATUS_QUARANTINED;
      $this->updatedAt = new \DateTimeImmutable();
  }

  public function isQuarantined(): bool {
      return $this->status === self::STATUS_QUARANTINED;
  }
  ```

